{
  "name": "CAG Calibration",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CAG Calibration\n\nScore a known-answer Q/A battery against ONE document to measure how reliable the oracle is on *that* canon under *this* model — the escalation rate to expect before you trust it.\n\n```\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:5678/webhook/cag/calibrate \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n        \"document_id\": 7,\n        \"strict\": false,\n        \"qa\": [\n          { \"question\": \"What is the peak current limit?\", \"expected\": \"12 A\" },\n          { \"question\": \"When does thermal shutdown trigger?\", \"expected\": \"150 C\" }\n        ]\n      }'\n```\n\nThe response is `{document, n, correct, accuracy, strict, misses}`. `accuracy` ≈ 1 − the expected absent-miss rate for that battery; `misses` lists each wrong answer with what the model said. Ground truth is caller-supplied — this measures this canon under this model, not the model in general.\n\nNo credentials needed — cag-api does all the work.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "b7d2f3a1-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "How to use",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-320, -220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "cag/calibrate",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b7d2f3a1-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Calibrate Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [200, 0],
      "webhookId": "a4c1e2d8-6f3b-4e7a-9c2d-1b3e5f7a9c0d"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=http://cag-api:8000/documents/{{ $json.body.document_id }}/calibrate",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ qa: $json.body.qa, strict: $json.body.strict }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 3600000
        }
      },
      "id": "b7d2f3a1-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Calibrate CAG API",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [460, 0],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b7d2f3a1-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Respond With Score",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [720, -100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ success: false, error: $json.error?.message ?? $json.error ?? 'CAG API request failed' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 502
        }
      },
      "id": "b7d2f3a1-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Respond With Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [720, 120]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Calibrate Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Calibrate CAG API",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Calibrate CAG API": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond With Score",
